type: software
title: "Grothendieckian Universe"
abstract: "A puzzle game of the seven works of The Grothendieckian Programme by Vincent Liu: seven worlds, 57 levels and 221 puzzles on descent, topos theory, the Riemann Hypothesis, BSD, Hodge, abc and Langlands, each level one idea of a book."
